{"word":"ὑπηρέτης","uri":"hupêretês","senses":[{"word":"ὑπηρέτης","html":"<span class=\"entreea\"><span class=\"grec\">ὑπ·ηρέτης,</span></span> <span class=\"gens\">ου</span>\n(<span class=\"grec\">ὁ</span>)\n<div class=\"rub\"><span class=\"ruba\">I</span> rameur, matelot, tout\nhomme d’équipage (autre que les soldats de marine) sous les ordres\nd’un chef <span class=\"ital\">ou</span> patron, <span class=\"aut\">Dém.</span> <span class=\"refch\">690, 11 ;</span> <span class=\"ital\">cf.</span> <span class=\"refch\">37, 4</span> ||</div>\n<div class=\"rub\"><span class=\"ruba\">II</span> <span class=\"ital\">p.\next.</span> tout homme sous les ordres d’un autre, serviteur,\n<span class=\"aut\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"refch\">3, 63 ;</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">5, 111 ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">Plat.</span>\n<span class=\"oeuv\">Leg.</span> <span class=\"refpa\">620</span><span class=\"refpb\">a</span>, <span class=\"refpa\">720</span><span class=\"refpb\">a</span>, <span class=\"refpa\">873</span><span class=\"refpb\">b</span> ; <span class=\"ital\">joint à</span> <span class=\"grec\">δοῦλοι,</span>\n<span class=\"ital\">dat.</span> <span class=\"aut\">Plat.</span>\n<span class=\"oeuv\">Pol.</span> <span class=\"refpa\">289</span><span class=\"refpb\">c</span>, <span class=\"ital\">etc. ;</span> <span class=\"ital\">p. anal.</span>\n<span class=\"grec\">ὑπηρέτης θεῶν,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Eschl.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Pr.</span> <span class=\"refch\">954,</span> serviteur des dieux ; <span class=\"ital\">avec\nle dat.</span> <span class=\"grec\">ὑπ. τῷ θεῷ,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Plat.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Leg.</span> <span class=\"refpa\">773</span><span class=\"refpb\">e</span>, serviteur de la\ndivinité ; <span class=\"grec\">ὑπ. τοῖς νόμοις,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Plat.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Leg.</span> <span class=\"refpa\">715</span><span class=\"refpb\">c</span>, <span class=\"ital\">etc.</span> serviteur des lois ; <spa